# A swim at the surface with the mermaid suit, played with the transitions' steps and their diagonal as the home screen
# plays them, from swim.route's save: on foot down to 0:67, swimming down to 0:b7, up and left into 0:a6, then down into
# 0:b6 twice (1928, 2055), a few tiles above a whirlpool. The second time the steps take him further in than the game's
# own scroll would; the whirlpool takes him (2124) and brings him back at (9, 139), the place that scroll would have left
# him, and from there he swims on right into 0:b7 (2197) and up into 0:a7 (2239).
